# Wave T25 (Meadowbrook kit): reedbank — the ponds' dressed
# edge. Wet sand and damp mud underfoot, pebble speckle, and
# reed tufts with two cattail heads standing along the bank;
# the bottom rows darken to the waterline (the ponds lie
# south of every bank cell in town). Swaps 1:1 from the
# shipped flower-bank cells on both ponds' north banks —
# Orin trims the reeds to the same height on both banks;
# the banks now say so. A floor kind: walkable, encounter-
# free, no table change. (NO-SAME-KIT law: no other town's
# bank reads like this one.)
